<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Genentech started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Genentech started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it started coverage of Genentech Inc with near- and long-term buy ratings.  </p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/8 to 55-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
